sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant PayoutsEngine
    participant LaunchDarkly
    participant ConfigProfilesDB as pe-configuration-profiles-dynamodb-prod (DynamoDB)
    participant PayoutsDB as fxp-payouts-engine (DynamoDB)
    participant ApplyFinancial
    participant PayoutsPricingAPI
    participant CalendarAPI
    participant SNS
    participant PaymentControls

    Client->>PayoutsEngine: POST payoutsEngine/credit-transfer
    Note over Client,PayoutsEngine: Request contains RecipientData<br/>with billing_descriptor

    PayoutsEngine->>PayoutsEngine: Works out payment type
    Note over PayoutsEngine: Determines PTB (Pay To Bank)

    alt PTB Payment Type
        PayoutsEngine->>LaunchDarkly: Check entity enabled for configuration profiles
        LaunchDarkly-->>PayoutsEngine: Feature flag result

        alt Configuration profiles enabled
            PayoutsEngine->>ConfigProfilesDB: Get configuration profiles
            Note over ConfigProfilesDB: Contains entity info:<br/>- IsPsp<br/>- IsHighRisk
            ConfigProfilesDB-->>PayoutsEngine: Configuration profiles
        else Configuration profiles not enabled
            PayoutsEngine->>PayoutsDB: Get entity info
            Note over PayoutsDB: fxp-payouts-engine table<br/>Contains IsPsp, IsHighRisk
            PayoutsDB-->>PayoutsEngine: Entity information
        end

        alt Not Client Settlements
            PayoutsEngine->>PayoutsEngine: Validate supported country currency
            PayoutsEngine->>PayoutsDB: Lookup entity configuration
            Note over PayoutsDB: PK: Configuration<br/>SK: entityId<br/>Contains AllowedCountryCurrencyPairs
            PayoutsDB-->>PayoutsEngine: Entity configuration
            PayoutsEngine-->>PayoutsEngine: Validation result

            alt Not Israel bank
                PayoutsEngine->>ApplyFinancial: Validate bank details
                ApplyFinancial-->>PayoutsEngine: Validation result
            end
        end

        PayoutsEngine->>PayoutsDB: Get all routes
        Note over PayoutsDB: PK: RouteProfile#{ckoLegalEntityCode?.ToLower()}#{entityId}<br/>SK: {countryId}#{currencyId}#{routePaymentType}<br/>Can fall back to global route<br/>(PK: "global" from GlobalOptions.RoutingDynamicKey)
        PayoutsDB-->>PayoutsEngine: Routes

        PayoutsEngine->>PayoutsEngine: Validate routes
        PayoutsEngine->>PayoutsEngine: Check routes intersect with configuration profile

        alt Not Client Settlement
            PayoutsEngine->>PayoutsPricingAPI: Validate fees profile exists
            PayoutsPricingAPI-->>PayoutsEngine: Fees profile validation
        end

        PayoutsEngine->>CalendarAPI: Calculate Value Date
        Note over CalendarAPI: Uses Route.Bank.Scheme.CalendarCodes
        CalendarAPI-->>PayoutsEngine: Value Date

        PayoutsEngine->>SNS: Publish ProcessPayout command
        SNS->>PaymentControls: ProcessPayout event
        Note over PaymentControls: Gets routing config data:<br/>- BankProfileDemo.RoutingName<br/>- PayoutType: automatic/manual/autosettle<br/>- Payout bank

        PayoutsEngine-->>Client: 202 ACCEPTED
    end